Sigil is a city in [[Phenomena/The Pale|the Pale]] of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]]. [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Uriel|Uriel]] suggested the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] pay it a visit. There they were invited to a party of the nobility, and while they attended, [[Org/Sacrament|Sacrament]] massacred everyone else there.
